	(text "250 kHz. R62 input ceiling ~13.61 A nominal; 5 mOhm shunts retain 50 mA input steps.\nRV1 output ceiling ~0.90-9.11 A nominal. Start near 1 A; CW raises current.\nResistor and I2C limits are register-overridable, NOT independent fault protection."
		(at 21.082 259.842 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "08ce8d69-278c-4e67-ae5b-51603d100e6f")
	)
	(text "RV2: calibrate manual 12 V initially; CW raises voltage.\nManual/app selection is on CC_CONTROL; do not switch a live receiver blindly.\n~400 W output is an app ambition, NOT an autonomous power cap.\nBoth knobs at maximum and ESP-loss transitions remain unqualified."
		(at 241.3 234.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4b84242d-d658-42ae-943a-9cd46630d153")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG describes future bench input\nafter manual commissioning. It is NOT\na bypass or independent protection."
		(at 25.4 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6d19550e-dd73-4a64-a23a-2d7f55d940c5")
	)
	(text "J33 requires external Semitec 103AT-2: 10k +/-1%, B25/85 = 3435 K +/-1%.\nNot an arbitrary 10k NTC. Sensor placement and actual thermal coverage need validation."
		(at 304.8 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6dd2568e-9dc8-4c06-926f-e0b7e7be38d4")
	)
	(text "VAC bypass: place close to pins 32/33"
		(at 113.03 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "735717f7-57e9-46d0-ba4f-e8a7254f8f50")
	)
	(text "J32: reference/test only, no external power.\nExternal CE inhibit requires 1k series test lead.\nCE may become an open-drain output via I2C.\nDo not apply uncontrolled external logic voltage."
		(at 25.4 115.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f06a0d1-ebd6-4070-9f35-fa51f87e94e8")
	)
	(text "TP40-44: local bare PCB probe pads, not connectors or power outputs.\nFB pad must be adjacent to feedback node, with NO branch trace.\nUse low-capacitance probing and a short local ground; probing can disturb regulation."
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d34f2900-312b-44f0-8631-b838b2cd19d5")
	)
	(text "BQ25756 ADAPTIVE PROTOTYPE - NOT FOR ENERGIZATION"
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e805e9dd-a67b-4402-ba4e-77b4a8fd2221")
	)
	(text "Isolated current-limited source only. Initially LOAD DISABLED; follow startup profile review.\nJP30 / JP31 wire links OPEN until supervised commissioning. NO battery approval.\nCold start permits manual CV with CE low; charger phase and retained registers still matter.\nI2C links join ESP bus (BQ 0x6B); J32 is NOT an external power input. CE test lead requires 1k.\nGenerator OV disconnect, reverse blocking, receiver OVP/OCP and Ioff remain unresolved.\n70 V-class target: ACOV static screen 67.47-69.68 V; this is not a surge disconnect.\n67.2 V conditional on per-unit range/calibration, NOT guaranteed; maximum-knob thermal proof pending."
		(at 16.764 268.732 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "efbdbe55-9c5e-4697-956b-d784aeacdc49")
	)
	(text "Kelvin shunt taps. No reverse blocking or output disconnect.\n100 V FETs / capacitors do NOT protect BQ 85 V absolute limits."
		(at 33.02 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fffdda03-8965-4236-8332-aa22ae638723")
	)
	(text "EEU-FR2A101 100uF/100V THT: input 2 upstream + 3 local; output 5 local + 2 receiver-side.\nBulk minimum after tolerance/endurance screen: 300uF input / 420uF output. Keep C77-C80 ceramics.\n1.5Arms per part: full-current sharing NOT qualified. Check loop stability, inrush and 22mm height."
		(at 215.9 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6c618ccc-28a6-4782-8902-cd304ef5c2bb")
	)
